\newlabel{fig:cvbars}{{2}{9}{Paired, seed-clustered bootstrap 95\% confidence intervals for the mean CV gap (relevant elaboration minus token-matched filler) at each length tier and pooled across tiers. Only the medium tier and the pooled estimate exclude zero}{figure.2}{}}
