\newlabel{fig:permodel}{{3}{11}{Per-model paired bootstrap estimates of the medium-tier elaboration-minus-filler CV gap. The positive direction holds across all three same-provider models, though only gpt-4o-mini's confidence interval individually excludes zero}{figure.3}{}}
