\newlabel{fig:entropybars}{{4}{12}{Mean logprob-entropy proxy (first-20-token entropy, nats) across the seven content-type by length-tier conditions, pooled over 16 seeds and 3 models. Entropy stays nearly flat across filler tiers but rises monotonically with relevant-elaboration length}{figure.4}{}}
